<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main>
    <h1>How it works</h1>
    <p class="lead">From the last day of the semester to move-in, Deadweight handles the heavy lifting in five steps.</p>

    <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><span class="num"></span><div>
            <h3>Request storage</h3>
            <p>Tell us what you're storing, roughly how much space it needs, and your preferred pickup and return dates.</p>
        </div></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="num"></span><div>
            <h3>We approve and schedule</h3>
            <p>Our staff review your request, confirm the volume, and lock in a pickup window that works for you.</p>
        </div></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="num"></span><div>
            <h3>Doorstep pickup</h3>
            <p>We collect your items, photograph them for your records, and check them into storage.</p>
        </div></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="num"></span><div>
            <h3>Safe summer storage</h3>
            <p>Everything stays in a monitored facility. You can track the status of every request from your dashboard.</p>
        </div></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="num"></span><div>
            <h3>Return for move-in</h3>
            <p>On your chosen return date we deliver everything back, ready for the new semester.</p>
        </div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/requests/new" class="btn btn-primary">Request storage</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Ask a question</a>
    </div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
